I don't like passing,

269
00:13:19,660 --> 00:13:21,550
which is why I do come out to people.

270
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:24,170
I'm very proud to be a black American.

271
00:13:24,170 --> 00:13:26,190
I'm very proud to be who I am.

272
00:13:26,190 --> 00:13:28,540
And I think that if you're
not proud to be who you are,

273
00:13:28,540 --> 00:13:31,330
