and barely making ends meet

287
00:14:05,375 --> 00:14:09,830
and feeling limited in job
choices because of who I am,

288
00:14:09,830 --> 00:14:13,700
but I still wouldn't trade being myself.

289
00:14:13,700 --> 00:14:15,093
So at all.

290
00:14:17,845 --> 00:14:20,512
(upbeat music)

291
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:28,170
- My family is pretty,
well, they think that,

292
00:14:28,170 --> 00:14:29,440
they say that they're liberal,

293
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,690
but they're pretty conservative

294
00:14:30,690 --> 00:14:31,730
