333
00:16:08,737 --> 00:16:10,597
"Well, I need to iron this, you know,

334
00:16:10,597 --> 00:16:12,387
"just to make sure that it looks nice

335
00:16:12,387 --> 00:16:13,690
"the next time I wear it."

336
00:16:13,690 --> 00:16:16,063
So I accidentally on
purpose, burned a hole in it

337
00:16:16,063 --> 00:16:18,440
