like be, make friends,

355
00:17:16,130 --> 00:17:18,090
you know, in school and stuff like that.

356
00:17:18,090 --> 00:17:23,090
So now I'm sort of, you know,
sort of learning those things.

357
00:17:23,620 --> 00:17:24,930
There's a lot of things that I don't know

358
00:17:24,930 --> 00:17:28,430
