360
00:17:30,790 --> 00:17:35,300
So I kind of, I tend to defer more.

361
00:17:35,300 --> 00:17:38,170
Like, I don't know.

362
00:17:38,170 --> 00:17:43,170
When someone's talking to me,
if I'm talking with a woman,

363
00:17:43,510 --> 00:17:45,780
