377
00:18:18,570 --> 00:18:21,160
at people full in the face, you know?

378
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:22,693
And that's been hard.

379
00:18:24,890 --> 00:18:28,390
In terms of, but I think
also being a black man

380
00:18:28,390 --> 00:18:31,940
