man, and they're like,

385
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:46,730
okay, what's he gonna
do to me kinda thing.

386
00:18:46,730 --> 00:18:49,024
You know, and what am I, you know,

387
00:18:49,024 --> 00:18:50,850
when I think about me, it's like,

388
00:18:50,850 --> 00:18:53,080
what am I going to do
to anybody, you know?

389
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:56,980
I mean, I can remember last
winter getting stuck somewhere

390
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:59,340
