391
00:18:59,340 --> 00:19:01,020
looking for someone to stop and help me.

392
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:01,853
And nobody would stop.

393
00:19:01,853 --> 00:19:02,720
It's like, what am I going to do?

394
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:05,160
Carjack you from my wheelchair, you know?

395
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:09,263
I mean, and all I needed
was a push out of the snow.

396
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,832
Finally someone stopped, and,

397
00:19:11,832 --> 00:19:13,300
