400
00:19:15,690 --> 00:19:18,063
It's like, no, if you
would just come push me,

401
00:19:18,063 --> 00:19:20,380
I could get where I need to go, you know?

402
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:22,573
'Cause I was like a block from my house,

403
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:24,930
it was like, you call the police,

404
00:19:24,930 --> 00:19:27,330
