exactly the same thing,

406
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:32,360
but I'm gonna be frozen, you know?

407
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:35,520
So I don't get that.

408
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:38,510
I don't understand like how that works,

409
00:19:38,510 --> 00:19:42,770
