419
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:14,005
and I'm trying to change that.

420
00:20:14,005 --> 00:20:17,490
I have a lot of internalized
racism and prejudice,

421
00:20:17,490 --> 00:20:19,810
and I'm trying to change that.

422
00:20:19,810 --> 00:20:23,043
In terms of the way that the
media portrays black men,

423
00:20:25,210 --> 00:20:27,850
I have a lotta issues, a
lotta issues around that

424
00:20:27,850 --> 00:20:32,256
because I know that
I'm perceived that way,

425
00:20:32,256 --> 00:20:36,720
