make my life easy or hard.

444
00:21:29,850 --> 00:21:33,220
It's not, you know, it's
not a choice that I have.

445
00:21:33,220 --> 00:21:35,470
It's something that I have to do,

446
00:21:35,470 --> 00:21:38,200
